+/* Livebook-style simultaneous source+preview — shown below the raw-markdown editor while it's
+   open, not instead of it, updating live on every keystroke (GramaireNotebookIsland.tsx's own
+   `previewBlocks`, recomputed from the draft, not the last-committed `block.text`). A muted
+   label + a lighter background distinguish it from the read-only rendered view a click normally
+   collapses to, so it doesn't read as "two copies of the same text by accident." */
